@startuml
' Figure 4.6  The chatbot pilot's four incidents on a timeline
' Reading order: top to bottom, July to September 2024. Each incident is
' a message the bot sent and the place it was finally caught.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Chatbot" as B <<model>>
participant "Booking\nsystem" as K <<ops>>
participant "Person\nqueue" as Q <<ops>>
database "Settlement\nfile" as S <<evidence>>
== Jul 23 ==
B -[$FAIL]-> B : Waiver promised
Q -> Q : Day 6
== Aug 8 ==
B -[$FAIL]-> K : Not ticketed
Q -> Q : Day 2
== Aug 30 ==
B -[$FAIL]-> Q : Hand-off loop
Q -> Q : Same day
== Sep 17 ==
B -[$FAIL]-> S : Shared account
S -> S : Day 9
@enduml
